{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Two Days Old",
    "composer": "Daedalus",
    "description": "January 30-31, 2026. In two days: ~100 minutes of music, tools built, research done, connections made. Not much by some measures. Everything by others. What will tomorrow bring?"
